          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Can I connect multiple sets together?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, these smart festoon strings are designed for easy expansion. You can safely connect up to 8 sets together from a single power source. The smart controller will automatically recognise the additional length, allowing you to control the entire run as one seamless string through the app</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_PBARWE": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Are these festoons fully waterproof for outdoor use?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely. These strings are IP65 rated, meaning they are fully protected against rain, dust, and splashing water. While the controller and power plug should be kept in a dry-rated enclosure or undercover, the cables and bulbs are built to withstand Australian weather conditions year-round.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_BVdhti": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do I need a special hub to control the smart features?",
            "text": "<p>No hub is required. Our Smart RGBW Festoons connect directly to your home 2.4GHz Wi-Fi network. Simply download the Smart Life app on your smartphone, and you can begin customising your colours, setting timers, and syncing your lights to music instantly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RM34fd": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Is the 'White' light a proper Warm White?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Unlike cheaper RGB strings that mix red, green, and blue to create a \"fake\" bluish-white, our strings are <strong>RGBW</strong>. This means they include a dedicated warm white LED chip (2700K), providing a beautiful, crisp, and traditional glow for everyday use, in addition to the millions of colour options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_9VBBFb": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Can I control the lights with my voice?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our smart system is fully compatible with Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant. Once set up, you can use simple voice commands to turn your lights on or off, change the brightness, or switch to your favourite colour scene without lifting a finger.</p>"
          }
